    "innovation": "This study quantifies how climate feedbacks from natural wetlands and permafrost thaw, using an updated climate model, reduce permissible anthropogenic CO2 emission budgets by 9-15% for a 1.5\u00b0C warming target and 6-10% for a 2.0\u00b0C target.",
    "kg_extraction_triplets": [
